      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Comic panels → MiniMax H3\n1. Choose the local model and mmproj in Llama Vision Settings.\n2. Replace the up to nine panels (the nine fixtures are preconnected) with your panels. Each socket takes one image.\n3. The prompt node schedules Llama Vision Chat once per panel, sequentially. No manual Llama Chat node is needed.\n4. Run to preview the prompt, structured analysis and warnings. Review uncertain text/identities.\n5. MiniMax H3 and Save Video start muted. Enable BOTH only when you want video generation (Comfy API account/credits required).\n6. Keep source image order identical on both nodes. The shared duration drives both.\nExtra instructions: camera=static|slow_zoom_in; pace=slow|natural; motion=subtle|hold.\nThe drawings are synthetic fixtures, not a quality benchmark."
      ]
    },
